{
  "capitulo": 4,
  "titulo_es": "Habla más despacio",
  "titulo": { "en": "Speak more slowly" },
  "intro": { "en": "The tú command for telling someone to do something." },
  "palabras": {
    "habla": { "en": "speak (tú command)", "pron": "A-bla", "cat": "verb" },
    "come": { "en": "eat (tú command)", "pron": "KO-me", "cat": "verb" },
    "escribe": { "en": "write (tú command)", "pron": "es-KRI-be", "cat": "verb" },
    "ven": { "en": "come (tú command)", "pron": "ben", "cat": "verb", "nota": "Venir is irregular: ven, not viene." },
    "haz": { "en": "do, make (tú command)", "pron": "ath", "cat": "verb", "nota": "Hacer is irregular: haz." },
    "más despacio": { "en": "more slowly", "pron": "mas des-PA-thyo", "cat": "expression" },
    "por favor": { "en": "please", "pron": "por fa-BOR", "cat": "expression" },
    "no hables": { "en": "don't speak", "pron": "no A-bles", "cat": "verb", "nota": "The negative command changes the vowel: habla, but no hables." }
  },
  "bloques": [
    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "The tú command",
      "texto": "For a regular verb, the affirmative **tú** command is the same as **él/ella** in the present.\n\n- hablar → **habla**\n- comer → **come**\n- escribir → **escribe**\n\nTwo irregulars you need immediately: **ven** (come) and **haz** (do).\n\nThe negative is different: **no hables**, **no comas**. The vowel changes. You will see that pattern again with the subjunctive."
    },
    {
      "tipo": "dialogo",
      "titulo": "In class",
      "frases": [
        {
          "quien": "Lucía",
          "es": "Habla más despacio, por favor.",
          "en": "Speak more slowly, please.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Habla", "command"],
            ["más despacio", "more slowly"],
            ["por favor", "please"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "Escribe tu nombre aquí.",
          "en": "Write your name here.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Escribe", "command"],
            ["tu nombre", "your name"],
            ["aquí", "here"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Lucía",
          "es": "Ven a la pizarra.",
          "en": "Come to the board.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Ven", "command (come)"],
            ["a la pizarra", "to the board"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "No hables tan rápido.",
          "en": "Don't speak so fast.",
          "analisis": [
            ["No hables", "negative command"],
            ["tan rápido", "so fast"]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tipo": "vocabulario",
      "palabras": ["habla", "come", "escribe", "ven", "haz", "más despacio", "por favor", "no hables"]
    },
    {
      "tipo": "huecos",
      "id": "a2-imp-habla",
      "pregunta": { "en": "Complete the command: speak more slowly." },
      "frase": "___ más despacio, por favor.",
      "audio": true,
      "opciones": {
        "Habla": { "en": "The affirmative tú command of hablar is habla." },
        "Hablas": { "en": "Hablas is the normal present, not the command." },
